  "definition": "Permits by Notification",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-08-02",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16; ss by #13425, eff 8-2-22",
